 "headline": "“you can’t always get what you want but we got everything we wanted last night” — cHRISTIE BRINKLEY",
 "intro": "TO CELEBRATE THE MOST LEGENDARY ROCK BAND OF ALL TIME AND THE RELEASE OF THEIR NEW ALBUM, WE HELPED PRODUCE A STAR-STUDDED EVENING WITH A SURPRISE PERFORMANCE.",
