   "title": "ENVIRONMENTal decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>In an homage to the iconic logo and the visuals for <em>Hackey Diamonds</em>, we incorporated deep lush reds throughout the venue and incorporated roses and crystals that created fractal lighting effects reminiscent of diamonds. Dramatic light design amplified the experience.</p>",
